          "short": "$2;\\ |x+\\frac12|=\\frac52;\\ -\\frac12;\\ \\frac52;\\ 2;\\ -3$.",
          "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}|2x+1|&=5\\\\\\left|x+\\frac12\\right|&=\\frac52\\end{aligned}$\n\nThe centre is $-\\frac12$ and the distance is $\\frac52$. Thus $x=-\\frac12+\\frac52=2$ or $x=-\\frac12-\\frac52=-3$.",
